# Mutant Surveyor {2}{B}, 2/3: Start your engines!; "{2}: This creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn"; "Max speed — {3}, Exile
# this card from your graveyard: Draw a card" (CR 702.178a-b: a static ability of the card that functions in the graveyard).
# Cast on turn 1 (Mox Jet, Mox Ruby, Mox Pearl) it gives Bot1 speed 1 (CR 704.5aa); a Lightning Bolt to Bot2's face on each of
# turns 1, 3 and 5 raises it once a turn: 2, 3, 4 (CR 702.179d). On turn 5 the {2} pump (Mox Jet and Mox Pearl, the pool empty) makes
# it 3/4 until end of turn. Bot2's Bolt on turn 6 kills it (2/3 again: the pump ended; a 3/4 would have lived). On turn 7, at speed
# 4, Bot1 exiles it from the graveyard for {3} and draws the card after the turn's draw, Memnite. Bot2 casts its own Surveyor on turn 2 and
# Bolts it: at speed 1 on turn 4 it cannot use the graveyard ability, and Bot1's activation on turn 7 leaves Bot2's card in Bot2's graveyard.

